<title>UK: Euromarket turnover rose in week to Oct 10 -ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover rose in week to Oct 10 -ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in Eurobond and related markets rose to $1.0733 trillion in the week to October 10 from $1.0315 trillion the previous week, International Securities Market Association data showed (in billions of dollars):</p>
<p>					  Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		     51.88		58.29</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues     26.63		29.81</p>
<p> Secondary market:		 1021.42	     973.23</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues    210.04	     209.57</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear	750.04	     713.92</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	    323.26	     317.60</p>
</text>
